-[1.02] transition-all\">Saber</div><div class=\"bg-white/80 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center font-medium text-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all\">Sniper</div><div class=\"bg-white/80 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center font-medium text-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all\">Storm</div><div class=\"bg-white/80 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center font-medium text-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all\">Thunder</div><div class=\"bg-white/80 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center font-medium text-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all\">Trouble</div><div class=\"bg-white/80 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center font-medium text-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all\">Zane</div></div></div></div><div id=\"baby\"><div class=\"bg-rose-50 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-100\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\">🍼<!-- --> <!-- -->Baby Names<!-- --> for <!-- -->African Civet<!-- -->s</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-2\"><div class=\"bg-white/80 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center font-medium text-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all\">Baby</div><div class=\"bg-white/80 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center font-medium text-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all\">Bebe</div><div class=\"bg-white/80 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center font-medium text-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all\">Bit</div><div class=\"bg-white/80 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center font-medium text-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all\">Bitty</div><div class=\"bg-white/80 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center font-medium text-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all\">Chipmunk</div><div class=\"bg-white/80 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center font-medium text-gray-800 shadow-