 your pet's personality, be easy to pronounce and remember, and ideally be one or two syllables. The best names reflect something unique about the animal while being practical for everyday use.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Should I choose a name based on my african civet's appearance?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Absolutely! african civet's distinctive features make wonderful naming inspiration. Names based on color, size, or markings create an immediate connection and help others appreciate your pet's unique beauty.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Can I use a human name for my african civet?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Human names are very popular for pets! Names like Charlie, Max, Luna, and Bella work wonderfully and can make your bond with your african civet feel even more personal and meaningful.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"How many names should I consider before choosing?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"We recommend shortlisting 3-5 favorite names, then testing them over a few days. Say each name aloud during different activities — the one that consistently feels natural is your winner.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"4\",{\"cl